OL,3,APrince Harry says it is 'great' to be
OL,4,Aback in Britain after six years in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex has said it feels
OL,7,F"great" to be back in Britain after
OL,8,Fspending six years living in
OL,9,FCalifornia.
OL,11,FHe told Canadian network CTV: "It's
OL,12,Fbeen great. It's been great to be back
OL,13,Fon British soil. The kids are happy in
OL,14,Fschool and it gives me a chance to be
OL,15,Fable to really focus on the Invictus
OL,16,FGames in Birmingham in July next year."
OL,18,FPrince Harry and Meghan stepped back as
OL,19,Fsenior royals and began a new life in
OL,20,Fthe US in 2020, before returning to
OL,21,Flive in Britain last month.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
